data: {"id": "c39a57a1721a40fc-thinking-parallel_evidence-769", "run_id": "c39a57a1721a40fc", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "两次重试仍然返回 `query_rejected` 状态，说明这是**系统层面的权限限制**，不是偶发问题。日志和追踪的底层基础设施（Elasticsearch 和 DeepFlow/ClickHouse）由于权限问题无法被访问。\n\n让我用 `kubectl_logs` 作为替代方案，直接通过 Kubernetes API 获取目标 Pod 的日志，不依赖 Elasticsearch。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788427342298, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

