data: {"id": "c39a57a1721a40fc-final", "run_id": "c39a57a1721a40fc", "seq": 1679, "ts_ms": 1788427383701, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2` | CreateContainerConfigError | Pod workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2 持续处于 Pending 状态，Container app 处于 Waiting 状态，Reason 为 CreateContainerConfigError |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.app` waiting reason: `CreateContainerConfigError` (fact-0bafe27c7037) | 确诊容器配置阶段失败，属于启动前错误 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.app` waiting message: `couldn't find key unavailable-key in Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input` (fact-0bafe27c7037) | 明确缺失资源标识，直接指向 Secret 配置错误 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | Pod `phase`: `Pending` (fact-53824a9c5119) | 状态未推进至 Running，与配置校验失败的机制一致 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"CreateContainerConfigError\"}` = 1 (fact-b8c1ff19cd68) | 独立数据源佐证等待原因为配置错误 |\n| 5 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` = 0 (fact-23d241a295c0) | 确认从未启动成功，非运行时反复崩溃 |\n\nKubernetes 事件明确指出了 `CreateContainerConfigError` 的具体成因（Secret key 不存在），Metric 指标从集群维度验证了容器一直停留在等待状态且未发生过重启，两者互证。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nSecret workload-input 缺少 key 'unavailable-key' → kubelet 解析 Pod spec 时校验失败 → 容器配置阶段直接返回 CreateContainerConfigError → Pod 持续 Pending 且 app 容器处于 Waiting 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因**：Pod 环境变量配置了无效的 Secret 引用。\n具体而言，Pod `workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2` 尝试从 Secret `aiops-case-04/workload-input` 中获取 `unavailable-key`，但该 Secret 中实际仅包含 `available-key`。由于该引用未设置 `optional: true`，kubelet 在启动容器前进行配置校验时直接报错，导致容器无法创建。证据编号：1, 2, 4。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.6m\n├─ 问题定位: 19.3s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 66.6s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2: 66.6s (Evidence 57.2s, RCA 9.3s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.1s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2**: pod-config-error\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 93.962, "metrics": {"run_id": "c39a57a1721a40fc", "mttr": {"value": "1.6m", "seconds": 93.96780347824097, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-config-error", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-config-error"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 93967.80347824097, "llm_calls": 22, "llm_duration_ms": 87292.06895828247, "tool_calls": 25, "executed_tool_calls": 20, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 4, "successful_tool_calls": 23, "failed_tool_calls": 2, "tool_duration_ms": 13541.912078857422, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 6144.958972930908}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 19271.82126045227, "success": true}, "parallel_evi